{"format":"markdown","content":"cardPDP11: a PDP-11 Emulator for M5Stack Cardputer

A portable PDP-11/40 and PDP-11/23 emulator for the M5Stack Cardputer. Boot legendary operating systems like Unix V6, RT-11, RSX-11/M, or UNIX V5 directly from your SD card using the Cardputer's physical keyboard and display!

Only tested on Cardputer ADV"}

