{"format":"markdown","content":"[GBCAMS] ESP-NOW sender firmware for UnitCamS3-5MP. Streams MJPEG to a M5Cardputer receiver without any WiFi router — ~25fps, 12KB frames packed into 9 ESP-NOW v2.0 large packets, auto-discovery beacon, auto-reconnect after link loss.

UnitCamS3-5MP 发送端固件：不用路由器，直接把 MJPEG 推给 M5Cardputer 接收端，约 25fps，12KB 一帧打成 9 个大包（ESP-NOW v2.0），自带发现信标、失联自动重连。接收端会自动识别（右上角蓝标 ESP-NOW）。

⚠️ 需要接收端一起刷：GBCAMS Receiver (M5Cardputer)"}

{"format":"markdown","content":"[GBCAMS] AP-HTTP MJPEG sender for UnitCamS3-5MP. Same SSID and API as the stock firmware (UnitCamS3-WiFi, /api/v1/stream) — works with the official app and with the GBCAMS Cardputer receiver (auto-detected, yellow AP label). ~12fps, camera reset + triple buffering.

UnitCamS3-5MP 发送端固件（兼容官方 App）：沿用出厂固件相同的 SSID 与接口（UnitCamS3-WiFi, /api/v1/stream），既能被官方 App 使用，也能被 GBCAMS 接收端自动识别（右上角黄标 AP），约 12fps。

