{"format":"markdown","content":"Initial Cardputer ADV + U214 public beta, HW11. Adds keyboard controls and credential entry, no-PSRAM memory settings, shared LoRa/SD bus handling, region validation, Recon-only non-repeating RTTTL alerts and stopped-capture upload support.

Both board builds and host tests passed; HW11 application installation and independent flash readback passed. Candidate hardware checks confirmed navigation, credential typing, US region persistence, SD capture/readback, LoRa reception and custom tones.

Still unverified on this exact release: physical browser factory installation; Launcher installation, auto-start and menu return; battery/sleep/wake; sustained interactive capture and latency targets; known-source RF matching and saved GPS geotags; live firmware upload receipts. See the GitHub validation report for scope."}
